WEBVTT

00:55:57.788 --> 00:56:01.204
And remember, we can talk about making a
difference. We could make a difference.

00:56:01.246 --> 00:56:03.996
Well, we can do both. I'm
Debbie Millman and

00:56:03.996 --> 00:56:06.371
I look forward to talking
with you again soon.

00:56:09.038 --> 00:56:11.329
Special thanks to the sponsor
of this episode.

00:56:11.329 --> 00:56:16.371
Hoffler and Co Design Matters is produced
by Curtis Fox Productions and

00:56:16.454 --> 00:56:18.788
on Pandemic Times. The
show was recorded at

00:56:18.788 --> 00:56:22.538
the School of Visual Arts Masters in
Branding Program in New York City,

00:56:22.663 --> 00:56:25.538
the first and longest running branding
program in the world.

00:56:26.204 --> 00:56:29.204
The editor in chief of Design
Matters is Zachary Petitt,

00:56:29.204 --> 00:56:31.371
and the art director is Emily Weiland.